/
FFDIV1,	0
	SNA		/WHICH MODE OF CALL?
	TAD I	FFDIV1	/CALLED BY USER-GET ADDR.
	DCA	FFSUB1	/STORE IT TEMPORARILY
	TAD	ACX	/NOW STORE THE FAC IN THE OPERAND
	DCA	OPX	/EXPONENT
	TAD	ACH
