	DCA I	FFDP	/('SPLIT' CHANGED TO PROPER D.F.)
	TAD	TM	/DO THE SIGN CALCULATION
	TAD	AC0
	DCA	TM
	DCA	AC0	/MUST BE ZERO FOR DIV. ROUTINE
